the news.

00:01:16.567 --> 00:01:17.734
President Biden has...

00:01:17.734 --> 00:01:18.901
-A loose cough.

00:01:18.901 --> 00:01:20.434
-"Loose cough."

00:01:20.434 --> 00:01:21.534
-A bit of a loose cough.

00:01:21.534 --> 00:01:23.234
-Loose cough.
-Loose cough.

00:01:23.234 --> 00:01:25.167
-Loose cough.
-A loose cough.

00:01:25.167 --> 00:01:26.934
-Jimmy, come on, man.
Seriously.

00:01:26.934 --> 00:01:28.300
